$NetBSD$

Use real EGL contexts/pbuffers and immutable GPU texture snapshots on GTK4.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted). wxWindows licence, like upstream.
Keeps native context identity, framebuffer zero and compatibility-profile GL.
Presentation is buffered; the pbuffer itself is single-buffered. Mesa maps
BACK names to its FRONT storage. Context resources share GTK's display group.
See tests/README.md for the precise contract and pending runtime acceptance.
https://docs.gtk.org/gdk4/class.GLTextureBuilder.html
https://registry.khronos.org/EGL/specs/eglspec.1.5.pdf

